        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 16.3. Employee concession rate service may be individual or party-line service as the employee may select. The Company, however, reserves the right of reassignment of individual line service to party-line service where regrading may be required in the interests of providing telephone service to other subscribers.",
